# Example ReRDMFT input file: He, cc-pVDZ, CASSCF over the full orbital space (2 electrons in 10 spinors) with the 4-component
# min-max stage (CASSCF_4C_NEG), SPEED_OF_LIGHT 20.
#
# Validation: for two electrons pCCD is exact with optimized orbitals, so he_pccd_c4_neg.inp (a different implementation) gives
# the same energies to 2e-10 Hartree. At SPEED_OF_LIGHT 20 the electron-positron relaxation is 8.6e-7 Hartree.
#
# Converged total energies:
#   no-pair (positive-energy-only) CASSCF: -2.8933945888 Hartree
#   min-max (including the negative-energy spinors): -2.8933937309 Hartree
NELEC 2
BASIS he-cc-pvdz.gbs
C4_SPINOR TRUE
CASSCF TRUE
CASSCF_ELECTRONS 2
CASSCF_SPINORS 10
CASSCF_4C_NEG TRUE
SPEED_OF_LIGHT 20
USE_RI FALSE

GEOMETRY
He  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
END
